Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Dire Maul East \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 55-60 Dire Maul East]
[NX 55-60 Dire Maul North]

Dire Maul is the broken elf city in the middle of Feralas. Dire Maul East is not entered from the main courtyard: go round the ruins on the outside to their east side, where a gate leads to the East portal. Its quests need level 54.

-- Left out: 7492 Camp Mojache (Horde): optional city breadcrumb; QuestieDB lists no prerequisite for 7489 and marks 7492 a breadcrumb (field 27). For Alliance, QuestieDB makes 7494 a prerequisite of 7488 (field 13), so the guide takes it.
-- Left out: 5527 A Reliquary of Purity and 5526 Shards of the Felvine (Rabine Saturna, Moonglade): the reliquary is fetched from Southwind Village in Silithus first, a two-zone side chain that is not a Feralas pickup.
-- Left out: 7463 Arcane Refreshment (Mage, level 60; Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum, Dire Maul North guide).
-- Left out: the Gordok, Shen'dralar, Elven Legends, class-book, Quel'Serrar and Dreadsteed quests; all start or end in the North or West wings and go to those guides.
-- Left out: 8948 to 8950 and 9015 (Anthion and Falrin chain) and 8967, 8970, 8990, 8996 (Bodley and Valthalak chain): the dungeon-set upgrade chains, which only pass through Dire Maul.

-- Horde: Camp Mojache, Azj'Tordin, the dungeon, back.
[A Horde] Start at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens; fly there if you know the flight path [G44.5,59.1 The Barrens] \\ No flight tag: this guide does not teach it.
[A Horde] South on the road to the top of the Great Lift [G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Elite Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (level 33-34) are close to the east of the lift.
[A Horde] Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
[A Horde] Follow the canyon west into Feralas [G30.7,24.4 Thousand Needles][G21.2,23.4 Thousand Needles][G18.5,22.3 Thousand Needles][G15.7,22.3 Thousand Needles][G13.0,21.5 Thousand Needles][G10.3,21.5 Thousand Needles] [OC] \\ An Enraged Panther and Rok'Alim the Pounder (elite, level 30) may be on the way.
[A Horde] West past Thalanaar (Alliance; keep south of its guards) and on to Camp Mojache [G87.0,48.5 Feralas][G81,46 Feralas][G78.5,45.0 Feralas][G77.2,43.3 Feralas][G75.95,43.55 Feralas][G75.6,43.65 Feralas][G75.5,44.4 Feralas] [OC]
[A Horde] At Shyn, get the Camp Mojache flight path [P Camp Mojache] [G75.5,44.4 Feralas]
[A Horde] Talo Thornhoof gives [QA7489 Lethtendris's Web] [G75.6,43.65 Feralas][G75.95,43.55 Feralas][G76.2,43.8 Feralas]
[A Horde] North out of camp to the pavilion on the hill [G76.2,41.2 Feralas][G76.9,37.4 Feralas] [OC]

-- Alliance: Feathermoon Stronghold, the boat to the coast, east across Feralas.
[A Alliance] In Ironforge, Courier Hammerfall gives [QA7494 Feathermoon Stronghold] [G55.9,81.4 Ironforge] \\ He walks about; Crier Goodman in Stormwind and Herald Moonstalker in Darnassus give the same quest.
[A Alliance] Fly to Menethil Harbor if you know the flight path [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge] \\ No flight tag: this guide does not teach it. Without it, walk in the next steps.
[A Alliance] Out of Ironforge and down to the Dun Morogh road, then east to the North Gate Pass [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh][G51.6,39.8 Dun Morogh][G56.9,47.1 Dun Morogh][G62.6,54.7 Dun Morogh][G67.0,52.5 Dun Morogh][G76.0,48.5 Dun Morogh][G81.5,41.0 Dun Morogh][G84.1,33.8 Dun Morogh] [OC] \\ QuestieDB places a Plague Zombie (level 50) near the road.
[A Alliance] Through the pass and north to Dun Algaz [G20.7,17.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan] [OC]
[A Alliance] North into the Wetlands and west along the road to Menethil Harbor [G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57.0,49.5 Wetlands][G49.5,40.0 Wetlands][G35.0,40.5 Wetlands][G26.3,40.5 Wetlands][G23.4,42.5 Wetlands][G22.4,44.0 Wetlands][G14.0,47.0 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands] [OC] \\ Elite Dragonmaw orcs, Highland Lurkers and Elder Crocolisks (level 27-30) and Modr and Golm (elite, level 32) are near the road; all are far below your level.
[A Alliance] Through the town to the south pier [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands][G4.7,63.8 Wetlands] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Theramore [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Off the pier and get the Theramore flight path if you lack it [P Theramore] [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] North out of Theramore along the shore road into the Barrens [G66.8,48.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.5,44.6 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.0,41.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.0,38.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.9,32.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.7,17.4 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.0,16.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G54.3,15.2 Dustwallow Marsh][G54.3,13.9 Dustwallow Marsh][G53.5,10.7 Dustwallow Marsh][G62.8,53.6 The Barrens] [OC] \\ QuestieDB lists Sully McCleary (level 50, hostile) near the road north of Theramore.
[A Alliance] West across the Barrens to the south road, then south to the top of the Great Lift [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58.0 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Northwatch Hold (Alliance) is to the east; Camp Taurajo (Horde) is off the road to the west near 44,59, keep clear of its guards. Elite Razorfen quilboars (33-34) are near the lift.
[A Alliance] Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
[A Alliance] Follow the canyon west to Thalanaar [G30.7,24.4 Thousand Needles][G21.2,23.4 Thousand Needles][G18.5,22.3 Thousand Needles][G15.7,22.3 Thousand Needles][G13.0,21.5 Thousand Needles][G10.3,21.5 Thousand Needles][G89.5,45.9 Feralas] [OC] \\ An Enraged Panther and Rok'Alim the Pounder (elite, level 30) may be on the way.
[A Alliance] At Thalanaar, get the flight path [P Thalanaar] [G89.5,45.9 Feralas]
[A Alliance] West along the south road past Camp Mojache and Dire Maul to the coast pier [G81,46 Feralas][G79.4,50.9 Feralas][G77,52 Feralas][G70,51 Feralas][G63,49 Feralas][G61.5,47.5 Feralas][G55.1,44.7 Feralas][G50.0,43.7 Feralas][G44.8,43.0 Feralas][G43.1,42.8 Feralas] [OC] \\ Camp Mojache (Horde) lies just north of 79,46; Gordok ogres (elite, 52-54) walk the road by the ruins; a Vale Screamer (level 60) is near the pier.
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold [G43.1,42.8 Feralas]
[A Alliance] Off the pier and south to Fyldren Moonfeather; get the Feathermoon flight path [P Feathermoon] [G31.0,39.5 Feralas][G31.0,42.2 Feralas][G30.2,43.3 Feralas] \\ QuestieDB lists a hostile level 60 Altruist Ward near the inn; read it as a scripted marker, not a mob (judgement, unverified).
[A Alliance] Latronicus Moonspear takes [QT7494 Feathermoon Stronghold] and gives [QA7488 Lethtendris's Web] [G30.4,46.2 Feralas]
[A Alliance] North along the island to the pier [G30.2,43.3 Feralas][G31.0,42.2 Feralas][G31.0,39.5 Feralas] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to the Feralas coast [G31.0,39.5 Feralas] \\ Stay on board until it docks on the mainland.
[A Alliance] Off the pier and east along the road to the Dire Maul ruins [G43.1,42.8 Feralas][G44.8,43.0 Feralas][G55.1,44.7 Feralas][G63.8,44.7 Feralas] [OC] \\ A Vale Screamer (level 60) near the coast pier; Gordok Ogre-Mages and Enforcers (elite, level 52-54) and Gordok Hyenas walk the road along the south wall of the ruins.
[A Alliance] Past the south-east corner of the ruins and north-east to the pavilion on the hill [G66.5,41.3 Feralas][G70.0,37.3 Feralas][G73.4,33.9 Feralas][G75.2,35.2 Feralas][G76.9,37.4 Feralas] [OC] \\ Camp Mojache (Horde) is to the south-east; keep north of it. Namida Grimtotem (elite, level 43) and Grimtotem Shamans and Naturalists camp near 68,39.

-- Both.
Azj'Tordin, the dragon in elf form at Lariss Pavilion, gives [QA7441 Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin] [G76.9,37.4 Feralas]
West to the outside of the east wall of the ruins [G75.2,35.2 Feralas][G73.4,33.9 Feralas][G70.0,33.6 Feralas][G66.5,32.7 Feralas] [OC] \\ Namida Grimtotem (elite, level 43) camps near 68,39; Gordok Maulers (elite, level 53-54) patrol by the east gate.
Go in by the east gate to the Dire Maul East portal [G64.8,30.2 Feralas] [OC]

-- Inside.
Find Pusillin and kill him for the book [QC7441] \\ No source we read gives his spot in the wing.
Kill Lethtendris for the web [QC7488][QC7489]
Leave the dungeon [G64.8,30.2 Feralas] [OC]

-- Turn-ins.
Back east along the wall and up to the pavilion [G66.5,32.7 Feralas][G70.0,33.6 Feralas][G73.4,33.9 Feralas][G75.2,35.2 Feralas][G76.9,37.4 Feralas] [OC]
Azj'Tordin takes [QT7441 Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin] [G76.9,37.4 Feralas]
[A Horde] South back into Camp Mojache [G76.2,41.2 Feralas][G76.2,43.8 Feralas] [OC]
[A Horde] Talo Thornhoof takes [QT7489 Lethtendris's Web] [G76.2,43.8 Feralas]
[A Alliance] Back west past the ruins to the coast pier [G75.2,35.2 Feralas][G73.4,33.9 Feralas][G70.0,37.3 Feralas][G66.5,41.3 Feralas][G63.8,44.7 Feralas][G55.1,44.7 Feralas][G44.8,43.0 Feralas][G43.1,42.8 Feralas] [OC]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold [G43.1,42.8 Feralas]
[A Alliance] Off the pier and south to Latronicus [G31.0,39.5 Feralas][G31.0,42.2 Feralas][G30.2,43.3 Feralas][G30.4,46.2 Feralas] [OC]
[A Alliance] Latronicus Moonspear takes [QT7488 Lethtendris's Web] [G30.4,46.2 Feralas]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
